# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
/target/
/gen/schemas

# The Xcode project is regenerated from gen/apple/project.yml on every
# `tauri ios build`, and it carries a per-developer Apple DEVELOPMENT_TEAM.
# Don't track it: it churns and would leak the signing team. project.yml (the
# durable source, incl. the Homebrew/cargo PATH fix in the build script) IS
# tracked, so a build regenerates a correct project.
/gen/apple/app.xcodeproj/

# The Android Studio project is tracked (like gen/apple) so the manifest
# customization (the nosdesk:// OIDC intent-filter) and the adaptive launcher
# icons are reproducible. The nested gen/android/.gitignore + app/.gitignore
# already exclude build output (build/, .gradle, .cxx, jniLibs *.so) and the
# per-machine generated files (tauri.settings.gradle carries absolute paths,
# local.properties the SDK path). icons/android is the `tauri icon` intermediate,
# not used by the build (gen/android/.../res holds the committed icons).
/icons/android/
# Kotlin compiler caches not covered by the nested .gitignores.
/gen/android/**/.kotlin/
